                <mxCell id="n1" value="• Flow 1 is the only path on the 30s chat budget. Ingest/evaluate/batch happen after 200 via Kafka (Flow 2).&#10;• Arrow from generate_answer to error END is taken on LLM 5xx/timeout — no assumptions, no Kafka, no Mongo write.&#10;• The only arrow into Fine-Tune :8004 is Flow 3 finetune_trigger. There is no arrow from evaluate_turn to POST /train.&#10;• Free chat never enters Flow 1 or Flow 2. Unauthenticated chat never reaches Agents.&#10;• Duplicate Kafka deliveries hit ingest_turn which upserts on correlation_id (one document)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="36" y="790" width="1700" height="120" as="geometry"/>
